32"} {"question" "q-19036" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Rearranging the dot product formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  & =\\frac{a\\cdot b}{|\\,a\\,||\\,b\\,|} \\\\  & =\\frac{{a}_{x}{b}_{x}+{a}_{y}{b}_{y}+{a}_{z}{b}_{z}}{\\sqrt{{a}_{x}^{2}+{a}_{y}^{2}+{a}_{z}^{2}}\\sqrt{{b}_{x}^{2}+{b}_{y}^{2}+{b}_{z}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\cdot 3+(-3)\\cdot 4+2\\cdot 1}{\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+(-3)^{2}+{2}^{2}}\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+{4}^{2}+{1}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{29}\\cdot \\sqrt{26}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{754}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\theta =\\operatorname{arccos}⁡(\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{754}})≈{85.82}^{∘}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040103/state.json" "file_sha256" "a76a2d55fe4cfab0d7e16df12e92bb8e31ac112f538228a90f5596ed85e85232"} {"question" "q-19036" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040103/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "6ec99b73bd0e45287c6205dca701f4d8435e073bd05cb9cfc6c557ae7078ee9b"} {"question" "q-19036" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040103/state.json" "file_sha256" "a76a2d55fe4cfab0d7e16df12e92bb8e31ac112f538228a90f5596ed85e85232"} {"question" "q-19036" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{74.66}^{∘}"] ["math" "{79.76}^{∘}"] ["math" "{82.28}^{∘}"] ["math" "{85.82}^{∘}"] ["math" "{94.32}^{∘}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14040103/state.json" "file_sha256" "a76a2d55fe4cfab0d7e16df